# Local development secrets ONLY. Never commit real values.
# Copy to backend/.dev.vars (gitignored) for `wrangler dev`.
# Production: use `wrangler secret put <NAME>` instead.

# Comma-separated CORS allowlist for local dev, e.g. unpacked extension origin.
# Find it at chrome://extensions after loading unpacked (the ID under the name).
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS="chrome-extension://<dev-extension-id>"

# Future server-side credentials (do NOT create until the gateway ships):
# NAWAASK_PROVIDER_API_KEY=""
# NAWAASK_JWT_SECRET=""
